* Common-base input characteristic (PNP 2N3906)
* inner sweep: VEE (emitter supply)   outer sweep: VCB = -5, -25, -45 V
VEE nes 0 DC 0
RE nes e 1k
Q1 c 0 e Q2N3906
RC ncs c 0.1
VCC 0 ncs DC 0
.MODEL Q2N3906 PNP(IS=1.41F XTI=3 EG=1.11 VAF=18.7 BF=180.7 NE=1.5
+ ISE=0 IKF=80m XTB=1.5 BR=4.977 NC=2 ISC=0 IKR=0 RC=2.5
+ CJC=9.728P MJC=.5776 VJC=.75 FC=.5 CJE=8.063P MJE=.3677 VJE=.75
+ TR=33.42N TF=179.3P ITF=.4 VTF=4 XTF=6 RB=10)
.SAVE all @q1[ic] @q1[ib] @q1[ie]
.DC VEE 0 5.3 0.001 VCC 5 45 20
.PROBE
.END
